"P4138573133" "This is the body of one of the crew of the cargo vessel. It looks like he's been nearly torn apart by something. From the terrified look on what's left of his face, it probably chased him down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BlechleyLoc 
