// IntroString :
"P1993217162" "I just got word from my family about the codes you stole from the Council, and the news is not good. We may already be too late. The Council already brought in their cargo yesterday. The strange thing is, ship's still in port and it's still filled with Council troops. This makes me think that either whatever they smuggled is still on board, or the Council's still busy cleaning the ship out to make sure no one else knows it was ever aboard. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We may still be able to hurt them if we hurry. And I really want to hurt them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P509194534" "Check out the ship"
// SendOffString :
"P4206804871" "Whatever the Council shipped in, it may still be on that boat. Even if it isn't, there may be some clues to what it was and where they moved it. The Council's sure to have some firepower in there, and you'll also have to take them out to keep our part in this secret."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1029725951" "Search ship & defeat Council"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P996413928" "Tell me when you've found something and taken care of the men on that ship."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2844215192" "The holds of this old freighter don't feel right somehow, as if something very bad happened here recently."

